# Built plugin output (each TypeScript plugin is its own compile unit — tsconfig.plugins.<name>.json,
# all built by npm run build:ts). No bundled plugin is TypeScript today — the last two moved to the
# plugin registry — so nothing is listed here; the next one to land adds its own line.
*.tsbuildinfo

# Built plugin UI bundles (generated by npm run build:plugins-web from plugins/*/web-src). Named one by
# one rather than a blanket plugins/*/web/, so a plugin that ships a hand-written (build-free) bundle
# stays tracked instead of being silently ignored.
plugins/subagent/web/
